{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE3L0FuZCUyMFRoZW4lMjBUaGVyZSUyMFdhcyUyMEV2ZSUyMCUyODIwMTclMjkv","type":"movie","name":"And Then There Was Eve","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/11ZPBk3VgJPqKUzpdRKGrL3StkP.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xhXmpkleWMPHyBSe70fShO8ipUF.jpg","description":"Alyssa, a successful photographer, wakes one morning to find her apartment ransacked and her husband mysteriously missing. Left without even a photograph to offer the police, she turns to her colleague Eve, a talented jazz pianist with a flirtatious charm and disarming grace. Eve helps her confront her husband’s longtime struggle with depression and to, over time, accept his absence. While getting to know this woman through such unusual circumstances, Alyssa is surprised to find herself falling in love again.","releaseInfo":"2017","genres":["Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.9","runtime":"98 min","cast":["Tania Nolan","Rachel Crowl","Mary Holland","Karan Soni","Anne Gee Byrd","John Kassir","Mapuana Makia","Jake Dynabursky"],"director":["Savannah Bloch"],"released":"2017-06-18T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Tania Nolan","character":"Alyssa","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3KjmnQOudgnwV7xTiHphmuJMXFN.jpg"},{"name":"Rachel Crowl","character":"Eve","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zuTdIqVyMgjy6hgPIVPIB5MiYKK.jpg"},{"name":"Mary Holland","character":"Laura","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/iwEK2fIrU1q7aijjD8FI9hCUMEL.jpg"},{"name":"Karan Soni","character":"Zain","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/t3eNrzRKy3wTVCUiEp002UXbjxX.jpg"},{"name":"Anne Gee Byrd","character":"Blythe","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/yNqUNepmVQ462yoTnZOWVbudKeG.jpg"},{"name":"John Kassir","character":"G. Alexander","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/byj6Px0tLcqRFWIJYUxstg25Qd2.jpg"},{"name":"Mapuana Makia","character":"Mia","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/an0wVDWMVWCiwjXU